libgrape-lite
------------------------------------------
libgrape-lite is a C++ library from Alibaba for parallel graph processing.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libgflags2.2-2.2.2-1
  libglog2-0.7.1-1bl2
  libgomp1-14.4.0-1
  libgrape-lite-devel-0.3.5-1bl1
  libgrape-lite0-0.3.5-1bl1
  libopenmpi40-4.1.6-1
  librdkafka++1-2.16.0-1bl1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.4-1
  cygport-0.37.11-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libgflags-devel-2.2.2-1
  libglog-devel-0.7.1-1bl2
  libopenmpi-devel-4.1.6-1
  librdkafka++-devel-2.16.0-1bl1
  librdkafka-devel-2.16.0-1bl1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/alibaba/libgrape-lite

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/alibaba/libgrape-lite/archive/refs/tags/v0.3.5.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libgrape-lite-0.3.5-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libgrape-lite-0.3.5-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libgrape-lite-0.3.5-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libgrape-lite-0.3.5-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libgrape-lite0-0.3.5-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libgrape-lite-devel-0.3.5-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

